==Strategy==
==='''Chapter 1 & 2'''===
As with many of the Cats of the Cosmos stages, [[Surfer Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Castaway Cat]] works great. The abundance of [[:Category:Red Enemies|Red]] is not an issue but can be capitalized on through use of [[:Category:Anti-Red Cats|anti-Red]] [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rares]]; otherwise they should not be the focus of the stage.

==='''Chapter 3'''===
Due to the lack of Red enemies, you do not need to bring any anti-Red units. Seafarer Cat is just as effective as in Chapter 1. Bring a [[:Category:Barrier Breaker Cats|Barrier Breaker]] or [[Ototo Corps#Breakerblast|Breakerblast]] for the [[Ribbo]].

